Changes made for this project:

- SKILL.md is rewritten in Japanese for the pptx_create tool of Production Ready Agent.
  Only the guidance that applies to that tool is kept: one message per slide, the main
  message first and a conclusion with next steps last, a structure that matches the size
  of the deck (no introduction and conclusion in a short deck, dividers between topics in
  a long one), no period at the end of a slide title, speaker notes in the notes instead
  of on the slide, and splitting a slide instead of shrinking or overflowing its text.
  The rule that bullet characters are not typed into the item text is stated in the
  argument description of the pptx_create tool
  (agent/backend/app/features/agent/pptx_tool.py).
- The following guidance is applied in the generator of the pptx_create tool
  (agent/backend/app/features/agent/pptx_presentation.py and chart_drawing.py) instead of
  in SKILL.md: an explicit 16:9 slide size, a white background, the title at the same
  position, font and size on every slide of the same type, left-aligned body text, list
  text of at least 14 pt that is never shrunk to fit (content that does not fit is
  rejected), real list items instead of typed bullet characters, native charts instead of
  rendered images, no legend for a single series, and the same label style on every
  chart.
- This project uses one fixed look that differs from the design ideas of the original:
  one typeface for all text, a thin accent line under the slide title, and slides made
  only of text, tables and charts.
- Everything else is not included: the scripts, running code (pptxgenjs, Python,
  LibreOffice), reading and editing existing files and templates, themes, layouts and
  sections chosen per deck, color palettes, images and icons, and the QA procedures.
